      "html": "<h1>A free AI model for your apps.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get a free key in one minute and call the model from any app, script or chatbot. It speaks the OpenAI API, so your existing code works. Free beta, limited capacity.</p><div class=\"flow\"><div>Your app<small>any OpenAI SDK</small></div><i>→</i><div>Flisk Inference<small>free model</small></div><i>→</i><div>Answer<small>text or JSON</small></div></div><div class=\"cta\"><a class=\"btn primary next-cta\" data-next-cta=\"\" href=\"?section=keys\">Get a free API key</a><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#demos\">See it work</a></div><ul class=\"proof\"><li>No card, sign in with GitHub</li><li>Works with any OpenAI SDK</li><li>Also reviews your service.json in pull requests</li></ul><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"https://chat.flisk.si\">Try it in chat →</a><a href=\"#api\">API quickstart →</a><a href=\"https://github.com/flisk-sh/flisk-inference\">Source on GitHub →</a></div></div><div class=\"demo card\"><div class=\"demo-label\">You ask</div><div class=\"demo-q\">Write a Flisk service.json for a worker called emailer in the shop stack.</div><div class=\"demo-label\">You get</div><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"btn sm copy\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button><pre><code class=\"hljs language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"schemaVersion\"</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"appName\"</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"emailer\"</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"appType\"</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"worker\"</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"stack\"</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"shop\"</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"demo-note\">A real answer from the model.</div></div></div><section class=\"block\" id=\"demos\"><h2>See it work</h2><p class=\"sub\">Five real runs: write a file, a one-shot job, fix a rejected file, ask the docs, and suggest fixes in CI. Nothing here is edited.</p><div><div class=\"tabs\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"on\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs1-write\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"tabs1-panel\" tabindex=\"0\">Write a file</button><button class=\"\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs1-job\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tabs1-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\">A one-shot job</button><button class=\"\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs1-repair\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tabs1-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\">Fix "
